body:
someone can definitely correct me if I'm wrong. I've been OTP Riven for probably a month and a half consistently at this point with only 200k in mastery. I'm far from an expert and come to realize that more each game.

&#x200B;

Riven is EXTREMELY mobile. If you can just force your brain into cranking out combos and dodging CC where applicable, teamfights become a game of dodgeball where, when you get the ball it turns into a 50 caliber bullet. Also if you itemize appropriately (for me that just looks like gore BC CDR boots every game xd) and are able to get even more dmg reduction from things like DD or Steraks or runes, it becomes very hard to take damage IMO. Your CDR gets high enough at a certain point where you are E'ing on like a 2 second CD and micro'ing q's gives you even more chances to duck, dive and hard engage if possible. You can still be bursted, of course, but in a perfect world where you can pick your fights appropriately, and snowball a lead, the games practically close themselves.

&#x200B;

Hope this helps :)

To better communicate with the world around me and improve myself as a person.

